  "configuration_id": "config_019",
  "reason": "The current best is config_018 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000, resnet50, avgpool, concat) at 0.619 accuracy. Evidence clearly shows multiprofile + avgpool + multimodal is the strongest combination, and transformer aggregation underperforms avgpool by ~4%. The key untested variable within this best configuration is the fusion strategy (concat vs. weighted). config_019 changes only the fusion from concat to weighted, providing a clean A/B comparison against config_018. This is the best use of experiment 7 because: (1) it isolates a single design choice that could yield a meaningful gain, (2) the result directly informs whether to build subsequent experiments around concat or weighted fusion, and (3) with 3 experiments remaining, confirming or ruling out fusion strategy now allows experiments 8-10 to focus on higher-impact variables (e.g., image encoder upgrade to ViT-L or RNA encoder swap) with the optimal fusion already fixed."
}

